'''Reinhardt''' is a [[Sub-Roles#Stalwart|Stalwart]] [[Roles#Tank|Tank]] [[Heroes|hero]] in ''[[Overwatch 2|Overwatch]]''. He is one of the 21 heroes included in the game's release on 24 May 2016.

