If D.Va uses Self-Destruct, try to quickly take her out and then put your barrier up to block the explosion. While it will most likely end up shattered in the process, you'll protect both yourself and any teammates behind you. A wily D.Va may be prepared for this, though, so be wary of her teammates comboing with her to take you or your barrier down before Self-Destruct detonates. Also, remember that D.Va cannot block your Earthshatter.</small>
