|<small>While Kiriko's {{al|Protection Suzu}} cannot remove pin from {{al|Charge}}, it can negate its damage or prevent it from hitting. It will also completely negate your {{al|Earthshatter}}, so do not use it before Kiriko has used her Suzu or try to bait her into using it with your Charge.</small>
|<small>(To be added)</small>
